      "message": "Lin: If `src_layers \u003e\u003d 2`, this `compute_flow_field()` call will also access `src_pyramid-\u003elayers[1]` and `ref_pyramid-\u003elayers[1]`, so the new check at line 798, which covers `layers[0]` only, is insufficient.\n\nCould you please look into this?",
