      "writtenOn": "2026-09-15T18:17:55Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "For layers 1 and above, both src_pyramid and ref_pyramid allocate intermediate buffers internally in aom_alloc_pyramid() (aom_dsp/pyramid.c:162-189). Their dimensions and strides are calculated purely as a function of (width \u003e\u003e level):\n  level_stride \u003d (padded_width + PYRAMID_ALIGNMENT - 1) \u0026 ~(PYRAMID_ALIGNMENT - 1);\n\nSince src_pyramid-\u003elayers[0].width \u003d\u003d ref_pyramid-\u003elayers[0].width is verified, all layers with level \u003e\u003d 1 are guaranteed to have identical strides.",
      "parentUuid": "73556b80_69660a20",
