      "message": "This `y_stride` check seems unrelated to the `xxx_pyramid-\u003elayers[0].stride` checks in the other two files. Are they related?\n\nWhat code requires `ref_buf[frame]-\u003ey_stride \u003d\u003d cpi-\u003esource-\u003ey_stride`?",
