      "writtenOn": "2026-09-15T18:17:55Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "They are directly related: for 8-bit frames, xxx_pyramid-\u003elayers[0].stride is initialized directly from frame-\u003ey_stride in fill_pyramid() (aom_dsp/pyramid.c:300).\n\nSince optical flow and corner matching require matching strides between source and reference for layer 0 (av1_compute_global_motion_disflow and av1_compute_global_motion_feature_match return false when layer 0 strides differ), checking ref_buf[frame]-\u003ey_stride \u003d\u003d cpi-\u003esource-\u003ey_stride in update_valid_ref_frames_for_gm() prunes out incompatible reference frames up front.",
      "parentUuid": "94f56353_1be4e7b4",
